<title>FRANCE: Cie Bancaire falls on broker downgrade.</title>
<headline>Cie Bancaire falls on broker downgrade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Cie Bancaire fell on Tuesday after SBC Warburg downgraded the stock to lighten from hold, fund managers said.</p>
<p>Warburg has set a target price of 720 francs per share and said its recommendation was based on Cie Bancaire's share price movement, fund managers said.</p>
<p>The stock was down 2.34 percent at 751 francs on volume of 53,317 shares, while the market was down 0.6 percent.</p>
</text>
